-- Big Apple Sam screen saver (linked to its GitHub release) and the Orders of Magnitude 4K/40K demos (shipped in public/files).
INSERT INTO files (area_id, filename, descr, size, uploader, uploaded_at, status, free, content, ctype) VALUES (1, 'BIGAPPLE.NFO', 'READ ME: Big Apple Sam screen saver', 1415, 'SysOp', 1792630293374, 'approved', 1, '==============================================================================
           B I G   A P P L E   S A M   ::   a screen saver for night owls
==============================================================================
 Remember After Dark''s Starry Night? The skyline with the little yellow
 windows? This is that, except you can zoom in, and every lit window is a
 room with people living out their evenings: dinners, fights, parties, a
 guitar at 3 AM, a kid''s nightmare. About 6,000 residents, one city per
 machine, on a live clock with a real sky.

 MAC (macOS 12 or later) ............................... BIGAPPLE.DMG
   Open it and double-click "Big Apple Sam.saver". It shows up under
   System Settings > Screen Saver. Options... lets you paste a city code
   and pick CGA, EGA, VGA or SVGA. If macOS balks the first time, go to
   System Settings > Privacy & Security and click Open Anyway.

 WINDOWS 10/11 ................... BIGAPPLE-SETUP.EXE or BIGAPPLE-SCR.ZIP
   Run the setup, or unzip the .scr, right-click it and choose Install.
   It isn''t code-signed, so if Windows says it protected your PC, click
   More info, then Run anyway.

 Or just watch it in a browser: samuelling.github.io/big-apple-sam
 (press S for the screen saver autopilot).

 By samuelling. Source: github.com/samuelling/big-apple-sam
==============================================================================
', 'text/plain');
